  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A travelling wave is described by the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The velocity of the wave is:</p><p>[All the quantities are in SI unit]</p>"
  },
